Live karne ke steps (Netlify - sabse easy, free):

Step 1: netlify.com par jaayein, free account banayein (email/Google se signup)

Step 2: Login ke baad "Add new site" → "Deploy manually" pe click karein

Step 3: Apni ecommerce-store.html file ko ek folder mein daalein, file ka naam index.html rakhein

Step 4: Us folder ko Netlify ke deploy page par drag-and-drop karein

Step 5: Kuch seconds mein aapko live link mil jayega (jaise random-name-123.netlify.app)

Bonus - custom domain: Agar apna domain (jaise satyammarket.com) chahiye, to GoDaddy/Namecheap se kharidkar Netlify settings mein "Domain management" se connect kar sakte hain.

Alternative - GitHub Pages:

github.com par account banayein
Naya repository banayein, usme index.html upload karein
Settings → Pages → main branch select karke save karein
Link milega: username.github.io/repo-name
Netlify zyada easy aur fast hai beginners ke liye. Koi step mein atke to batayein.

